{"3158500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Shoreline", "steam_appid": 3158500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158500/extras/c73405b2f17b7ecce009f16b540908fb.avif?t=1782399652\" width=616 height=124 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a corrupted beach.</strong></h2>Play as a Muri, a fish-mouse creature, and platform your way atop the pillar, run in the grass with pixies, venture to the beach, explore the cave, make your way high atop the mountain, and finally reach the cliff outlook by the beach in your explorations of Shoreline. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158500/extras/a8c6f30320831d9f54d653e9ef627409.poster.avif?t=1782399652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158500/extras/a8c6f30320831d9f54d653e9ef627409.webm?t=1782399652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleanse the world of corruption.</strong></h2>Use your trusty watergun to bring back the beach's beauty. Utilize your watergun in different ways to get rid of corruption, by using the wide spray or the pressure aim. Aiming can be used to clean, push, or break things while the wide spray is excellent for efficiently cleaning your close surroundings. Make sure also to give the cute little pixie creatures a wash as well, it makes them very happy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158500/extras/b72e2a64181c5b27a46f8d6688f88689.poster.avif?t=1782399652\" width=600 